  "chapter": "STARTING_OUT_WITH_LINES",
  "description": "This is the §3main food for bees§r, used to breed, collect, and incubate them. The processing line to obtain them is pretty complicated as it requires you to make §6honey§r, §6honeycombs§r, and some other dessert-based materials.

To get §6honeycombs§r you need to solidify honey with a honeycomb base. This base requires §l§9Polymethyl Methacrylate (PMMA)§r, an advanced acrylic used in place of glass in some real-world applications.

